00:13:37.820 --> 00:13:38.820
would be my guess.

00:13:38.820 --> 00:13:39.820
Yeah, yeah, yeah.

00:13:39.820 --> 00:13:40.820
It's enough.

00:13:40.820 --> 00:13:41.820
Very expensive, great ice cream.

