With antimatter.

00:14:01.860 --> 00:14:04.010
With anti-
How cold are we talking?

00:14:04.010 --> 00:14:05.030
10 millikelvin.

00:14:05.030 --> 00:14:07.970
So the universe at large is around 3 Kelvin.

00:14:07.970 --> 00:14:09.740
So that's outer space.

00:14:09.740 --> 00:14:11.780
That's not very cold compared to us.

00:14:11.780 --> 00:14:15.550
We are 100,000 times smaller in temperature.

00:14:15.550 --> 00:14:19.590
So this is the world's most powerful ... It's
