and you can pick out.

00:27:22.450 --> 00:27:24.450
And there's about 50 candidate isotopes.

00:27:24.450 --> 00:27:25.450
Mass.

00:27:25.450 --> 00:27:26.450
Yeah.

00:27:26.450 --> 00:27:27.450
Yeah.

00:27:27.450 --> 00:27:31.149
And then in order to detect something, the
